---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="Oculivo Features | Eye Care Practice Management" description="Explore Oculivo scheduling, patient, clinical, optical, billing, communications, document, staff, and reporting workflows.">
<main class="page"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Product</span><h1>Everything the practice needs, connected.</h1><div class="grid">{['Scheduling & appointments','Patients & intake','Clinical records','Optical inventory & orders','Insurance claims','Invoices & payments','Email, SMS, phone & fax','Documents & e-signatures','Team Chat','Time clock & staff','Reporting & automation','AI assistant'].map((x,i)=><article><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h2>{x}</h2><p>Built into the same tenant-secured Oculivo workspace so staff can move between workflows without losing patient or office context.</p></article>)}</div></div></main>
</Base>
<style>.page{padding:88px 0;background:#0b0b22;min-height:80vh}.eyebrow{color:#9183ff;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:11px}.page h1{font-size:clamp(42px,5vw,68px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.05em;max-width:820px;margin:18px 0 42px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.grid article{background:#171438;border:1px solid #2e2957;border-radius:22px;padding:24px;min-height:210px}.grid article>span{font-size:11px;color:#8175ca}.grid h2{font-size:20px;margin:28px 0 10px}.grid p{color:#aaa8c6;line-height:1.65;font-size:14px}@media(max-width:820px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.page h1{font-size:42px}}</style>
